{
  "id": 442872562,
  "iid": 22935,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "V5UA: Use proto_tree_add_item_ret_uint",
  "description": "The SAPI and TEI were being retrieved from the wrong offset -\nDLCI_TEI_LENGTH was subtracted from the offset *before* incrementing\noffset with DLCI_TEI_LENGTH. Also, both come by one octet fields,\nbut were being retrieved with tvb_get_ntohs.\n\nUsing proto_tree_add_item_ret_uint makes such mistakes very difficult\nto do, so use that.\n\nCoverity CID 1677860",
  "state": "merged",
